        <ExplanationTxt>COLORADO CHRISTIAN ACADEMY USES A 3RD PARTY VENDOR, FACTS, TO ANALYZE THE TRUE FINANCIAL NEED AFTER A FAMILY ASKS FOR TUITION ASSISTANCE AND SUBMITS A FORM THROUGH FACTS. FACTS RECOMMENDS VARIOUS LEVELS OF RECOMMENDED OF TUITION ASSISTANCE, AND COLORADO CHRISTIAN ACADEMY HAS A TUITION ASSISTANCE COMMITTEE THAT ANALYZES AND VOTES ON ALLOCATING THE TUITION ASSISTANCE TO THE FAMILY. THE ENTIRE PROCESS IS CONFIDENTIAL TO ENSURE UNBIASED ALLOCATIONS TO FAMILIES.</ExplanationTxt>
